{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Craft the Ultimate Synergy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/\u52a8\u7269\u5408\u96c6\u5c55\u793a.png?t=1745460506\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your dream team of extraordinary animal companions\u2014some strike with lightning speed, some form an unmoveable wall of defense\u2026 and others? They're just irresistibly adorable! Position them wisely, combine their abilities, and unleash devastating combos to wipe out the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Every Spin is a New Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/4-en.gif?t=1745460506\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Give the roulette a whirl and brace yourself\u2014every spin is a leap into the unknown! Will you land a devastating power-up, a game-breaking synergy, or a wild tactical twist that flips the battle on its head? One spin could turn the tide\u2026 or send you scrambling for a comeback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Face Off Against Ruthless Mechanical Beasts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/6.gif?t=1745460506\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your enemies are made of cold, unyielding steel, but don\u2019t be intimidated! Spin the wheel, command your animal squad, and fight your way through relentless battles. Didn\u2019t land on the tile you wanted? Just keep spinning!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/3-en.gif?t=1745460506\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rougelite roulette gameplay</strong> \u2013 Every spin brings a new surprise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hundreds of strategic combinations</strong> \u2013 13 animal types, 100+ animal tiles, and 100+ power-up stickers to mix and match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Creative mode supported</strong> \u2013 Modding and Steam Workshop integration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Asynchronous multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Compete for the top spot on the leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>More content is in active development </strong>\u2014 Join the factory and let's tinker together!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3371510?t=1745460506","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/1b523622853be109cabb90a64c7da83f01a8ff1f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745460506","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/ab595979645dfca8e1ecab48816c1ade7a3f1a17/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745460506","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/ab595979645dfca8e1ecab48816c1ade7a3f1a17/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745460506","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Join us</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/\u6807\u9898-\u82f1.png?t=1745460506\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">X:\u00a0<strong>@CLLC_studio</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tiktok:\u00a0<strong>roulettehero</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Craft the Ultimate Synergy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/\u52a8\u7269\u5408\u96c6\u5c55\u793a.png?t=1745460506\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your dream team of extraordinary animal companions\u2014some strike with lightning speed, some form an unmoveable wall of defense\u2026 and others? They're just irresistibly adorable! Position them wisely, combine their abilities, and unleash devastating combos to wipe out the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Every Spin is a New Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/4-en.gif?t=1745460506\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Give the roulette a whirl and brace yourself\u2014every spin is a leap into the unknown! Will you land a devastating power-up, a game-breaking synergy, or a wild tactical twist that flips the battle on its head? One spin could turn the tide\u2026 or send you scrambling for a comeback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Face Off Against Ruthless Mechanical Beasts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/6.gif?t=1745460506\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your enemies are made of cold, unyielding steel, but don\u2019t be intimidated! Spin the wheel, command your animal squad, and fight your way through relentless battles. Didn\u2019t land on the tile you wanted? Just keep spinning!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/extras/3-en.gif?t=1745460506\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rougelite roulette gameplay</strong> \u2013 Every spin brings a new surprise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hundreds of strategic combinations</strong> \u2013 13 animal types, 100+ animal tiles, and 100+ power-up stickers to mix and match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Creative mode supported</strong> \u2013 Modding and Steam Workshop integration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Asynchronous multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Compete for the top spot on the leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>More content is in active development </strong>\u2014 Join the factory and let's tinker together!</p></li></ul>","developers":["CLLC Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371510/acd3f31c056ae2c35a633597e35c3ab0fd2be2f9/header.jpg?t=1745460506","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257129775,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129775/movie480.mp4?t=1745460501","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129775/movie_max.mp4?t=1745460501"},"name":"RHtrailerEN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257129775/1d1428d469b6a5eb0d65c922cb44a229ddecae5b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745460501","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129775/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745460501","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129775/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745460501"}}],"name":"Roulette Hero","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> windows 7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Inter Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050/ AMD 560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>St